          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Consolas" fontSize="11" fontStyle="bold" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="custom" textColor="#3E2723" visible="true">TIM3_IRQHandler (1 kHz Trigger)
NVIC Prio: 5 (Highest Managed)
