          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Consolas" fontSize="11" fontStyle="bold" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="custom" textColor="#3E2723" visible="true">I2C1_EV / I2C1_ER ISR (W2.1)
NVIC Prio: 6 | 500 Hz Burst
EV5..EV8_2 / ER (AF, BERR, ARLO)
