          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Consolas" fontSize="11" fontStyle="bold" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="custom" textColor="#3E2723" visible="true">TIM2 (100 kHz) + RTC Wake + IWDG
