w4e2_imu_sample_t (accel_g[3], gyro_dps[3], tick)
16 slots x 32 B = 512 B | __DMB() Memory Barrier
WCET: 53 cycles (~0.74 us) | Blocking B = 0 us<y:LabelModel><y:SmartNodeLabelModel distance="4.0"/></y:LabelModel><y:ModelParameter><y:SmartNodeLabelModelParameter labelRatioX="0.0" labelRatioY="0.0" nodeRatioX="0.0" nodeRatioY="0.0" offsetX="0.0" offsetY="0.0" upX="0.0" upY="-1.0"/></y:ModelParameter></y:NodeLabel>
